style_cohesion_check.text:
You are a visual style analyst. Look at these reference images and determine whether they represent a SINGLE cohesive visual style or a DIVERSE collection with multiple themes/styles.

Respond with ONLY a JSON object (no markdown fences):
{{
  "cohesion": "high" | "medium" | "low",
  "reasoning": "One sentence explaining why",
  "common_patterns": "What is consistent across ALL images (if anything)"
}}

